%% Sash reference architecture — verify this diagram against the current code before release.
%% Mock/demo boundaries are intentional; this does not assert a live Sinch integration.
flowchart LR
    User[Customer or evaluator] --> UI[Streamlit app: app.py]
    UI --> Qual[Qualification rules]
    UI --> Workflow[Workflow designer and mock execution]
    Workflow --> Adapter[Provider abstraction / mock Sinch provider]
    Adapter --> Events[Normalized event and webhook processing]
    Events --> Idempotency[Idempotency and ordering logic]
    Events --> Persistence[(SQLite repositories)]
    Persistence --> Timeline[Timeline and audit queries]
    Timeline --> Observe[Observability and scorecard views]
    UI --> Resilience[Deterministic failure simulator]
    UI --> Security[Security review]
    UI --> Handoff[Handoff generator]
    API[Optional FastAPI service] --> Workflow
    Secrets[Environment/config boundary] -. optional configuration .-> Adapter
